                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;light-font&quot;>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-32-reg&quot;>We are looking for the brightest minds for the AbbVie trainee program.&amp;nbsp;Our trainee/rotation program offers young talents a unique opportunity to join our company.&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
