                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            jcr:title="Get to know three areas over a period of 18 months"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                            type="h2"
                            variant="h"/>
                        <text
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-11T01:12:08.599-04:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-10T15:05:52.984-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>As a trainee at AbbVie, you will have the opportunity to familiarise yourself with various departments through three rotations over a period of one and a half years and thus quickly build up a wealth of experience in different areas of the company, for example in Marketing, Medical Affairs, Customer Excellence, External Affairs, Market Access, Finance or Human Resources. You can have a say in at least one rotation.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>During your rotations, you will collaborate on projects, take on responsibility and provide support in day-to-day business. You will develop a cross-functional understanding of the pharmaceutical industry, AbbVie and our culture, build a comprehensive network within a matrix organisation and thus optimally position yourself for a career as a specialist or manager.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Our trainee programme focuses on your further development. Your progress and goals are recorded in a personal development plan. In addition, your manager and an onboarding buddy will be on hand to provide you with advice and support.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <separator
                            cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-11T01:12:13.271-04:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
