                        <title_copy
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678,1651545825693]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-11T01:12:03.814-04:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-10T15:06:07.924-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            jcr:title="Ideally, success means a shared future  "
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                            type="h2"
                            variant="h"/>
                        <text_copy
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-11T01:12:08.599-04:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-08-23T10:48:02.312-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="kaspatx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>Since the start of the trainee programme in June 2016, we have recorded many successes: nine out of ten trainees were permanently employed by AbbVie after completing the programme - for example, as Brand Manager, Medical Science Liaison, Business Finance Manager or Market Access Manager.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>As a young and dynamic company, we are always on the lookout for motivated talents who fit in with our open corporate culture.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Click on the links for two short interviews with former trainees:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.ch/content/dam/abbvie-dotcom/ch/documents/interview-romina-cabra.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Interview Romina Cabra&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.ch/content/dam/abbvie-dotcom/ch/documents/interview-joana-herter.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Interview Joana Herter&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>The dates for the next trainee program cycle will be announced here shortly.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                    </container_500097427>
